      "settings": {
       "editor": "<p>Here's a secret: amazing products fail all the time. Not because they weren't good. Because no one knew they existed.</p><p>We don't want that to be you.</p><p>Our marketing team helps you sound like yourself (but clearer). We plan your launch so it feels like an event, not a whisper. We help you find the first customers who'll become your biggest fans.</p><p>You built the collection. Let us help the world discover it.</p><p><strong>What you get:</strong></p><ul><li>Words that actually sound like you</li><li>In-depth growth marketing specialist who will work with meta suits, google ad, SEO optimisation etc</li><li>A launch plan that doesn't stress you out</li><li>Constructive guidance towards assured success</li><li>A nudge in the right direction when you're stuck</li></ul>",
